    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin adds the Atirame AI chatbot script to your WordPress website. It acts as an intelligent assistant that can automatically answer visitor questions.</p>\n<p>To get your custom chatbot script and configure it, you need to sign up at https://www.atirame.ir.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>atirame-chat-ai-help</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Go to Settings &gt; Atirame Chat AI Help and enter your script URL.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed Plugin Checker errors and simplified the code.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with basic functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
